  "description": "More Than Just Pages, It’s Your Personal Haven\nWhether you’re tracking habits, jotting down inspirations, or sketching out your dreams, this bullet journal is your perfect companion. It can follow you from your cozy Parisian cafe to a scenic spot by the Seine. It’s designed to be a personalized space where you can cultivate mindfulness, organize your thoughts, and nurture your inner peace.\nBring the Magic of Paris Home Today!\nReady to add a dash of Parisian chic and the romance of the City of Lights to your daily routine? Don’t wait to transform your planning into a delightful escape.\nPERFECT FOR:\n✨ personal use\n✨ print business\n✨ POD + dropshipping\nNOTE:\n*This is a digital product\n*No physical product will be shipped\n*You are NOT allowed to sell the products in any digital format\n*You are NOT allowed to give the products as a freebie (soft and hard copies)\n*You are allowed to sell the printed (hard copies) ONLY\n*You may also upload these to any dropshipping sites such as Amazon KDP, Printful, Printify, Gelato, RedBubble, and other platforms as long as your customers will only have access to the printed copies, and not the digital product\n*SIZE: A5\n*20 pages",
